      "@type": "LocalBusiness",
      "name": "InclusiFund",
      "description": "InclusiFund is a UK funding ecosystem focused on grassroots community organisations — specifically CICs (Community Interest Companies), small charities, and community-run businesses that sit below the £1M income threshold where most institutional funding stops looking. We pair grant-matching and application-writing services with building tools (websites, director dashboards, content systems) for the same operators. The worldview is set out at /manifesto; the impact ledger at /receipts. AntiGravity Projects is the build arm (web agency / digital studio) that delivers the technology side.",
